    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$3.11 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost) for meatballs in a smoky chipotle sauce, which is what a single order costs on the appetizer menu.",
    "shop_smart":  [
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eBread and milk stretch the beef, and that is on purpose.\u003c/strong\u003e The soaked bread panade is traditional, it keeps the meatballs tender, and it means less beef per serving without anyone noticing.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eOne can of chipotles in adobo lasts a long time.\u003c/strong\u003e Freeze the leftovers in a covered ice cube tray and pull out one cube at a time for future batches.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eCanned diced tomatoes beat fresh here.\u003c/strong\u003e They are cheaper year round, they are already peeled, and this sauce gets blended anyway so texture does not matter.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eCilantro goes in at the end.\u003c/strong\u003e It loses everything if it simmers, so save the whole bunch for the finish where you actually taste it."
                   ],
    "make_it":  [
                    "Weigh your empty mixing pot and write the number down for portioning later.",
                    "Tear the sandwich bread into pieces, soak it in the milk until soft, then mash it into a paste.",
                    "Mix the ground beef with the bread paste, eggs, some of the garlic, salt, and black pepper, and roll it into evenly sized meatballs.",
                    "Blend the diced tomatoes with the chipotles in adobo, the yellow onion, and the rest of the garlic into a smooth sauce.",
                    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large pot and pour in the blended sauce carefully, since it will spit. Cook it down for several minutes until it darkens and thickens.",
                    "Add the chicken broth, bring the sauce to a gentle simmer, and lower the raw meatballs in one by one.",
                    "Cover and simmer gently, without stirring for the first fifteen minutes so the meatballs set, until they are cooked through.",
                    "Cook the rice according to the package, then finish the pot with the chopped cilantro and adjust the salt."
                ],
